# .dockerignore -- keeps the Docker build context (see Dockerfile's
# `COPY . .` in the builder stage) limited to what `go build
# ./cmd/langstream` actually needs.
#
# This closes a real, previously-unnoticed gap: with no .dockerignore,
# `COPY . .` pulled in .git/ (repo history, several hundred KB and
# growing) and every top-level doc file on every build. The most costly
# part of that in practice is DEVLOG.md: per this project's own
# established pattern, it is appended to on essentially every sprint/day
# (see DEVLOG.md itself), and Docker's layer cache keys the `COPY . .`
# layer (and therefore the `go build` layer that follows it, since it's
# a separate RUN step but still invalidated once its input layer
# changes) off the exact contents copied. A pure documentation edit with
# zero effect on the built binary was silently forcing a full,
# uncached `go mod download`-adjacent rebuild step on every image build
# -- a real, quantifiable CI/local build-time cost for this SRE-owned
# charter item, not a style nit. Excluding docs/VCS metadata here means
# a DEVLOG-only change no longer busts the build layer's cache.
#
# Keep in sync with what cmd/langstream actually imports (see go.mod --
# no local `replace` directives point outside this repo, and cmd/langstream
# does not import examples/ or tools/, so those stay excluded too; if that
# ever changes, add the needed path back here).

# VCS metadata -- never needed to build the binary.
.git/
.gitignore

# Documentation -- edited far more often than source, never read by the
# build. See this file's header comment for why that specifically matters
# for Docker layer-cache invalidation.
*.md
docs/

# Not imported by cmd/langstream (see go.mod: no local replace directives
# point at either of these, and neither is a dependency of the binary
# Dockerfile actually builds).
examples/
tools/

# Local build artifacts / editor & OS cruft -- mirrors .gitignore's own
# list, so a locally-built binary or stray temp file never ends up baked
# into a build context by accident.
/bin/
/langstream
*.exe
*.test
*.out
*.go.[0-9]*
.DS_Store
*.swp

# CI/CD config -- irrelevant inside the image itself.
.github/
